          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "कैवणो (kaivṇo) is inherited from Sanskrit kathayati, \"converses with, describes\"; CDIAL lists the Old Marwari forms kahaï and kai under it (CDIAL 2703)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for asking and answering."
